# Sentry (error reporting). Leave empty/unset to keep Sentry fully
# disabled — no init, no network calls, no device log noise. As of this
# writing there is no DSN yet (pending from the CEO); the app runs
# correctly with this unset and starts reporting the moment a real DSN is
# filled in here (and in eas.json's build profiles), with no code change.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
